WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:02.419
Damian:
This is one of the craziest
people

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:05.714
Damian:
who pulled off one of the
biggest scams in American history.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:07.424
Amy:
We are looking for Eric Conn

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:11.553
for defrauding the U.S.
taxpayers of more than 550
million dollars.

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:13.555
♪♪

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:16.683
Ned:
Eric Conn was one of the biggest
lawyers here, in Appalachia.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.518
Jeff:
The town loved him and the
people loved him.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.478
He was a phenomenon.

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:21.688
Eric Conn was Mr. Social
Security.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.233
♪♪

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:27.569
Ned:
He was on the radio, he was on
television.

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:29.947
TV spokesman:
This has been an advertisement
for Eric C. Conn.

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:31.114
We laughed at him, you know.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:32.324
Melinda:
But everybody wanted to meet
him.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.911
You couldn’t miss him,
especially when he went on the
run.

00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:39.206
♪♪

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:40.916
Damian:
The way he did it was
incredible.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:43.835
Damian:
And there was porn stars, and
voodoo dolls,

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:46.797
Damian:
and Rolls Royces, and flashy
suits, and brothels.

00:00:46.797 --> 00:00:49.132
He opened a Halloween-themed
brothel.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.927
Nobody knows how many people
he’s been married to.

00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:55.889
Everything about this guy is too
much to believe, but it all
happened.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.099
♪♪

00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:58.684
At the time I thought he’s
helping me.

00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:02.020
Dennis:
I hit rock bottom. I lost
everything I had.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:04.064
Ned:
My clients are victims of his
criminal conduct.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:06.358
Damian:
This is one of the poorest parts
in the United States

00:01:06.358 --> 00:01:08.735
Damian:
and he’s getting filthy rich off
the whole thing.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.779
A ‘baller’ in the eastern
Kentucky.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:12.698
♪♪

00:01:12.698 --> 00:01:14.783
Damian:
There was three investigations
happening at once.

00:01:17.369 --> 00:01:20.080
My tires had been slashed with a
knife.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.249
Damian:
These were bad, bad people.

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:24.793
I lived in fear of going to
work.

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:26.795
♪♪

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:28.463
The politics stink to high
heaven.

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:32.843
The only thing government hates
more than a rapist or a child
molester is a tax-evader.

00:01:32.843 --> 00:01:33.969
We were like, ‘Freeze!'

00:01:33.969 --> 00:01:36.221
♪♪

00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:39.016
Damian:
He walked across the border with
a dog named Curly.

00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:41.101
Amy:
Through Mexico, into Guatemala.

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:43.228
Amy:
We were that close and now he’s
gone.

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:45.897
Damian:
Eric was planning his biggest
caper yet.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:49.276
♪♪

